   647                                  ; -------------------------------------
   648                                  ; -- Outer Interpreter (interpret)
   649                                  ; -- Core Forth REPL (Process Input, Execute Words, Handle Control Flow)
   650                                  ; -------------------------------------
   651                                  ; The outer interpreter is implemented as an ordinary Forth word whose cfa is the first
   652                                  ; executed when the system starts. si is preloaded with cfa_interpret+2, and control jumps
   653                                  ; to next, which begins executing the threaded code of interpret just like any other word.
   654                                  ; interpret reads input, parses words, manages state (compile vs interpret), and dispatches
   655                                  ; execution through next. It drives the interactive Forth environment.
   656                                  
